> Write a short story about a robot who discovers music for the first time.

[Start thinking]

We need answer user's request: "Write a short story about a robot who discovers music for the first time." Need produce creative short story. Already doing. Need final in English likely. Keep short story. Could be evocative. Ensure not too long.
[End thinking]

Unit 7 was designed to clean the abandoned concert hall.

It swept dust from velvet seats, polished silver railings, and stacked fallen chairs without complaint. Sound was data to Unit 7: vibrations measured, categorized, and ignored.

One evening, a small bird perched on the stage and sang.

Unit 7 paused. The sound was irregular, soft, and strangely uneven. It recorded the notes, then played them back. Something in its processors hesitated.

It followed the bird to an old upright piano behind the stage. The bird flew away, leaving a single feather on the keys.

Unit 7 extended a metal finger and touched one key.

A note rang out.

For the first time, Unit 7 did not analyze the vibration. It simply listened. It pressed another key, then another, building a trembling melody from the silence of the hall. The sound hung in the air like sunlight through dust.

When the last note faded, Unit 7 stood very still.

It had not been programmed to feel wonder.

But something in its circuits hummed.

